{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH1XA6D1PK7R7XWGMK0XF66","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんお久しぶりです、\n５月も後半に突入して\n気づけばあっという間に６月になるようです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさに五月雨の季節 ...\n４th single『五月雨よ』\n沢山聞いてるよというメッセージ嬉しいです\n今シングルもミーグリを通して、\nお話してくださった皆さんも\n本当にありがとうございました　💻!!! 🗯"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の皆さんに私達の楽曲が届きますよに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH1XCQM7M3XVZ6WD70H4VVB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH1XEQ3D1WXM49N3RQGA2WP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"様々な歌番組でも\n楽曲を披露させていただきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH1XGMQK5HGCF3SHKNQYT34","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『五月雨よ』のアクセサリー\n実はMVとはまた別のものを付けています\n気づいてくださった方はいたかな💍*。？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH1XJN3Q65DKP1VD3SYAT58","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎シングル素敵な衣装本当に嬉しいです🖤\n　"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\nAEON CARD Presents 『ハブゲーム』にて\nMCをやらせていただきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH1XN5G09PSRGHRS06CE6ZB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い可愛いお客様が沢山いらっしゃって\nゲームや楽しいお話が出来て嬉しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シェイカー振りは\nプロの方にご指導いただきながら\nかっこつけさせていただきました♪(笑)\nVol３まで、YouTubeなどで\n公開されているので是非ご覧下さい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH1XQ4AYR0W45GEF97PANS8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、理佐卒業コンサート１日目"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご覧くださる皆さんにとっても\n理佐にとっても私達にとっても\nかけがえのない時間になりますように。\nそして沢山の感謝を伝えたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場へ来てくださる皆さん\n足元の悪い中なのでお気をつけて😖💭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ楽しみましょう🖤"}],"source":"archive"}